# Two Borg spheres attack two birds of prey on layouts/shield-hit.jsonc, and the birds fire back. Each hit on raised
# shields shows the shield hit effect on the side facing the shot, sized to the target's shield ellipsoid, its ring
# flipbook stepping; a beam's effect ends after shieldDuration while the beam goes on. The shots are a tenth of a second
# apart; the dumps show the shields falling.
# Run it with --layout layouts/shield-hit.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.2
box Bush3 Bush4
wait 0.1
attack Open1
scroll up 8
wait 4.5
dump d1
shot hit-1
wait 0.1
shot hit-2
wait 0.1
shot hit-3
wait 0.1
shot hit-4
wait 0.1
shot hit-5
wait 0.1
shot hit-6
wait 0.6
shot hit-7
dump d2
